        "Automated deployment",
        "Saved time",
        "Saved money",
        "Cut processing time",
        "World-class",
        "Best-in-class",
        "High-performance",
        "Production-ready",
        "Enterprise-ready"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "soft-skills",
      "label": "VAGUE_CLAIM",
      "category": "Soft skills",
      "risk": "Medium",
      "why": "Soft skills are often subjective unless supported by concrete behavior.",
      "safer": "Add a project story, documentation, deadline, stakeholder, defect found, or collaboration example.",
